// Signing configuration.
//
// Your Team ID is personal and must not land in a public repo, so it lives in
// Local.xcconfig (gitignored). The `?` makes the include optional: CI and
// fresh clones build fine without it, they just can't sign for a device.
//
// To set yours up:
//   cp Local.xcconfig.example Local.xcconfig
//   # then put your 10-character Team ID in it
//   xcodegen generate

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
